on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [  3] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  6] get 4 ................................... <the volume of sound 3>
  [  8] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  9] gt ...................................... <the volume of sound 3 > 0>
  [ 10] jmpifz [ 33] ............................ if the volume of sound 3 > 0 then
  [ 13] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [ 16] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [ 19] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 22] get 4 ................................... <the volume of sound 3>
  [ 24] pushint8 20 ............................. <20>
  [ 27] sub ..................................... <the volume of sound 3 - 20>
  [ 28] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 31] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 3 to the volume of sound 3 - 20
  [ 33] ret
end
